:662267268,"node_id":"RA_kwDORZzCOc4neWWE","name":"SHA256SUMS","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":686,"digest":"sha256:3ae0fc5f5b5d0a32f0345724ab5df0aa548b21eb5f69a07b51bfba7f95553c73","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-21T11:23:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:23:31Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/electkismet/eltdx/releases/download/v3.3.0/SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/electkismet/eltdx/tarball/v3.3.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/electkismet/eltdx/zipball/v3.3.0","body":"## 主要变化\r\n\r\n- 新增扩展行情 `eltdx.ex`（7727），支持市场和标的查询、报价、K 线、分时及成交数据。\r\n- 新增 `eltdx.mac`（7615），包含同步客户端、编解码、价格规则与复权支持。\r\n- 新增 `eltdx.offline`，读写本地日线和分钟线文件，并读取板块、行业、历史财务及 GBBQ 文件。\r\n- 新增专业财报 `eltdx.financial`，补齐 7709 公司信息目录、正文和板块元信息命令。\r\n- 新增 `eltdx` 命令行工具及 `python -m eltdx` 入口。\r\n- K 线查询新增 `bar_time` 参数，可选择起点或右端点时间；默认保留原有时间语义，日线及以上不受影响。\r\n- 新增全市场统计和当日资金流辅助方法，补充接口说明及从 easy-tdx 迁移指南。\r\n\r\n## 修复内容\r\n\r\n- 修复 MAC K 线请求帧、港股本地日线成交额解释及本地行情文件残尾读取问题。\r\n- 补齐沪市 `5xxxxx` 和北交所 `4xxxxx` 代码识别。\r\n- 主机省略端口时自动补齐默认端口，修复裸 IPv6 地址解析。\r\n- 资金流为空时有界探测其他主站；所有主站都为空时仍返回空数据。\r\n- 扩展市场 CLI 默认使用内置市场表，显式指定 `--probe-server` 才探测服务器，避免无效等待。\r\n- 修正文档链接，并保持安装包内文档与文档站内容一致。\r\n\r\n## 兼容性\r\n\r\n从 `v3.2.3` 升级保留原有 API 默认行为。新增参数均提供默认值。\r\n历史扩展 K 线范围查询无法确定周期时长，传入 `bar_time=\"end\"` 时会显式报错。\r\n各在线接口的数据覆盖范围取决于服务器支持情况。\r\n\r\n## 升级\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython -m pip install --upgrade \"eltdx==3.3.0\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n感谢 [anjia0532](https://github.com/anjia0532) 在 [PR #20](https://github.com/electkismet/eltdx/pull/20) 中贡献新功能、协议修复和文档。\r\n"}